off at the same stops. \n\n▼\r\nMoGo Morgan Hill Quick Ride\t\n\nShow All Answers\n\n1.\nHow do I schedule a MoGo ride?\n\nBook trips with the MoGo mobile app (Apple App Store or Google Play), to get the most features including automatic alerts about the status of your ride.', 'title': 'FAQs • What type of seats can I book?'}
